-56542.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bill Ackman’s road to billions began with $14,000 and a Buffett-linked book]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133230253.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/before-becoming-a-billionaire-investor-bill-ackmans-journey-began-with-a-14000-harvard-sales-job-and-a-book-linked-to-warren-buffett/articleshow/133230253.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/before-becoming-a-billionaire-investor-bill-ackmans-journey-began-with-a-14000-harvard-sales-job-and-a-book-linked-to-warren-buffett/articleshow/133230253.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T11:25:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133230366,imgsize-77223.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[German startup Voodin swaps fibreglass for wood turbine blades, aiming for recyclable blades at commercial scale]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133229906.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A pioneering startup in Germany is crafting wind turbine blades using laminated veneer lumber, presenting a sustainable solution to the prevalent fiberglass composite problem. The initial prototypes are currently being tested in the field, demonstrating their potential. This innovation seeks to tackle the increasing challenge of waste generated by conventional wind turbine blades, with plans for larger models aimed at commercial projects on the horizon.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/german-startup-voodin-replaced-fibreglass-with-laminated-veneer-lumber-in-19-3-metre-turbine-blades-its-new-eu-backed-factory-targets-fully-recyclable-blades-at-commercial-scale/articleshow/133229906.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/german-startup-voodin-replaced-fibreglass-with-laminated-veneer-lumber-in-19-3-metre-turbine-blades-its-new-eu-backed-factory-targets-fully-recyclable-blades-at-commercial-scale/articleshow/133229906.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T11:08:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133230043,imgsize-103047.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Colorado mom gets her son ‘arrested’ after he refuses to take a first-day-of-school photo]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133230154.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/colorado-mom-gets-her-son-arrested-by-police-after-he-refuses-to-take-a-first-day-of-school-photo-with-officer-handcuffing-him-in-hilarious-prank/articleshow/133230154.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/colorado-mom-gets-her-son-arrested-by-police-after-he-refuses-to-take-a-first-day-of-school-photo-with-officer-handcuffing-him-in-hilarious-prank/articleshow/133230154.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T11:23:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133230299,imgsize-1185920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[After 14 years, Massachusetts dam removal begins to restore 7 miles of stream]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133216344.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-conservationists-began-working-to-remove-an-obsolete-massachusetts-dam-14-years-later-demolition-started-to-reconnect-7-miles-of-stream-and-restore-6-acres-of-wetland/articleshow/133216344.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2012-conservationists-began-working-to-remove-an-obsolete-massachusetts-dam-14-years-later-demolition-started-to-reconnect-7-miles-of-stream-and-restore-6-acres-of-wetland/articleshow/133216344.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T10:42:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133216452,imgsize-141309.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Six generations return to Lake Winnipesaukee for a century-old tradition]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133157996.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/people/six-generations-have-vacationed-at-new-hampshires-lake-winnipesaukee-one-family-still-spends-thousands-each-summer-to-keep-the-tradition-alive/articleshow/133157996.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/people/six-generations-have-vacationed-at-new-hampshires-lake-winnipesaukee-one-family-still-spends-thousands-each-summer-to-keep-the-tradition-alive/articleshow/133157996.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T10:42:20+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158064,imgsize-148815.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owens Reframes Kirk Assassination: Owens says grief fuels spiritual mission; video blends faith and audience engagement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133226534.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens has opened up about how her feelings changed following Charlie Kirk’s assassination. She said she has moved beyond the initial trauma and no longer feels haunted, instead believing Kirk is spiritually “fighting alongside” her. Owens connected her optimism to her belief that truth will prevail and said she feels Charlie is still with them. She also encouraged viewers to support her show by purchasing merchandise.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/candace-owens-says-she-feels-charlie-kirk-is-fighting-alongside-her-as-she-opens-up-about-his-assassination/articleshow/133226534.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/candace-owens-says-she-feels-charlie-kirk-is-fighting-alongside-her-as-she-opens-up-about-his-assassination/articleshow/133226534.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T05:32:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133226541,imgsize-97869.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Amazon AI Opt-Out Backlash: Twitch auto-enables training on streams; creators must change privacy settings]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133226553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch is facing criticism over a new setting that allows Amazon to use streamer content for generative AI training by default. Streamers can opt out through their privacy settings. Users questioned why the option was not turned off unless creators agreed. Twitch said it is not training GenAI models itself, but the setting covers Amazon’s AI model training.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-faces-furious-streamer-backlash-as-amazon-ai-training-opt-out-appears-enabled-by-default/articleshow/133226553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-faces-furious-streamer-backlash-as-amazon-ai-training-opt-out-appears-enabled-by-default/articleshow/133226553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T05:19:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133226554,imgsize-53592.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Old Graduation Clip Resurfaces: Clavicular’s virtual ceremony goes viral; fans see quieter past]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133226558.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A resurfaced video from Clavicular’s COVID-era middle school graduation has gone viral, giving fans a wholesome glimpse of the streamer before his rise to internet fame. The footage shows his name being announced during a virtual ceremony while his parents celebrate from home. Now 20, Clavicular has built a large following through IRL streams, looksmaxxing content and controversial online discussions, making the old clip especially surprising for fans.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/claviculars-old-graduation-video-sparks-massive-reaction-as-fans-discover-the-streamers-life-before-fame/articleshow/133226558.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/claviculars-old-graduation-video-sparks-massive-reaction-as-fans-discover-the-streamers-life-before-fame/articleshow/133226558.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T05:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133226566,imgsize-75950.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Paranormal Creator’s Fatal Crash: Jiang Xiaorou dies after July accident; family urges fans to stop speculation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133226573.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jiang Xiaorou, a 24-year-old Chinese paranormal content creator, died on August 10 after suffering severe injuries in a July 15 traffic accident. Known for challenging superstition, she had more than 1.28 million Douyin followers. Her controversial videos, including one showing her destroying a Guanyin statue, resurfaced after her death. However, there is no evidence linking her accident to supernatural punishment, despite speculation circulating online.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-was-jiang-xiaorou-the-haunting-story-of-the-chinese-tiktoker-whose-death-brought-her-most-controversial-video-back/articleshow/133226573.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-was-jiang-xiaorou-the-haunting-story-of-the-chinese-tiktoker-whose-death-brought-her-most-controversial-video-back/articleshow/133226573.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T06:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133226629,imgsize-99309.cms"/></item></channel></rss>